Let's see what we can do to minimise the pain.

For methods, can I suggest adding something like this:

If (missing(new_name) & !missing (old.name <http://old.name>)) {
  message("stuff")
  new_name <- old.name <http://old.name>
}

For functions

old.function <- function(old.name <http://old.name>) {
  message(stuff)
  new_function(old.name <http://old.name>)
}

Can someone make the necessary list; I have a few spare evenings?

Cheers,

pdm

